  "number": 4,
  "title": "Numbers and age",
  "goal": "Count to 100 and say how old you are.",
  "grammar": [
    {
      "title": "Age uses 'to me'",
      "explanation": "Russian says 'to me are 18 years': Мне восемна́дцать лет. Learn the 'to whom' words as a set: мне (me), тебе́ (you), ему́ (him), ей (her), вам (you, polite)."
    },
    {
      "title": "год / го́да / лет",
      "explanation": "The word for 'years' depends on the LAST number: 1 → год (21 год, 31 год); 2, 3, 4 → го́да (22 го́да, 33 го́да); 5–20 and 0 → лет (5 лет, 11 лет, 20 лет, 25 лет). 11–14 always take лет."
    }
  ],
